msgstr ""

msgid "If set to true then the container attempts to detect _wrong_ usages of annotations and eventually fails the build to prevent unexpected behavior of a Quarkus application."
msgstr ""

msgid "A typical example is `@jakarta.ejb.Singleton` which is often confused with `@jakarta.inject.Singleton`. As a result a component annotated with `@jakarta.ejb.Singleton` would be completely ignored. Another example is an inner class annotated with a scope annotation - this component would be again completely ignored."
msgstr ""

